              "id": "19858298"
            },
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "21059643"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Very highly expressed in host macrophages and when grown in an acidic environment; repressed by H-NS and induced by SsrB (PubMed:12949164, PubMed:19858298, PubMed:21059643). Repressed in conditions of high calcium and by osmotic stress (PubMed:12949164)"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "INDUCTION"
    },
    {
      "texts": [
        {
          "evidences": [
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "16849798"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Domains throughout the protein, and not only the N-terminus, are required for secretion and translocation. Both N- and C-terminal domains are also required for formation of tubules"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "DOMAIN"
    },
    {
      "texts": [
        {
          "evidences": [
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "8861213"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Cells lacking this gene do not produce Sifs in epithelial cells and show attenuated virulence in mice"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "DISRUPTION PHENOTYPE"
    },
    {
